    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote3" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the year ended December 31, 2024, Supply Corporation recorded a non-cash impairment charge of $39.0 million in Account 426.5 to write down the carrying value of certain assets associated with the Northern Access project, which Supply Corporation will no longer be pursuing. The impairment charge reduced the value of certain assets recorded in Account 183.2, Account 121 , Account 107 and Account 101 on the balance sheet.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value3" xlink:to="footnote3" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote6" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Supply Corporation redeemed $125,000,000 of 5.358% notes and $150,000,000 of 5.779% notes with the proceeds received from Associated Companies in March 2025. The 5.358% and 5.779% notes were redeemed for $125,271,363 and $151,405,826, respectively, plus accrued interest. The call premiums were recorded in Account 189, Unamortized Loss on Reacquired Debt, in March 2025.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value6" xlink:to="footnote6" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="6" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote7" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>In February 2025, Supply Corporation recorded a base gas sale of 126,957dth at a gain of $322,437. Supply Corporation received $412,610 in proceeds from this sale. This sale was authorized by FERC in Docket No. CP22-482-000.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value7" xlink:to="footnote7" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="7" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote11" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>$50,000,000 in advances from National Fuel Gas Company mature on 10/1/2026 and have been reclassified to Account 233 in recognition of the current status of the loan.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value11" xlink:to="footnote11" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="11" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote12" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>On March 6, 2025, Supply Corporation borrowed $25,000,000 from National Fuel Gas Company ("the Company") at an interest rate of 5.708%. The note matures on March 15, 2030. On the same date, Supply Corporation also borrowed $275,000,000 from the Company at an interest rate of 6.119%. This note matures on March 15, 2035. The proceeds of these debt issuances were used to redeem $125,000,000 of 5.358% notes and $150,000,000 of 5.779% notes on March 6, 2025. These notes were originally scheduled to mature on July 15, 2025 and January 15, 2026, respectively. The 5.358% notes and 5.779% notes were redeemed for $125,271,363 and $151,405,826, respectively, plus accrued interest. The call premiums were recorded to Account 189, Unamortized Loss on Reacquired Debt, in March 2025. The remaining debt issuance proceeds were used for general operating purposes.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>$50,000,000 in advances from the Company mature on 10/1/2026 and have been reclassified to Account 233 in recognition of the current status of the loan.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value12" xlink:to="footnote12" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="12" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote13" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Amount represents the annual FAS158 Adjustment to record the Actuarial determined Pension Benefit Obligation (PBO) adjustment for Supply's portion of National Fuel Gas Company's Executive Retirement Plan and Tophat Plan, which are Non-Qualified plans.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value13" xlink:to="footnote13" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="13" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote15" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>On March 6, 2025, Supply Corporation borrowed $25,000,000 from National Fuel Gas Company ("the Company") at an interest rate of 5.708%. The note matures on March 15, 2030. On the same date, Supply Corporation also borrowed $275,000,000 from the Company at an interest rate of 6.119%. This note matures on March 15, 2035.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value15" xlink:to="footnote15" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="15" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote16" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the year ended December 31, 2024, Supply Corporation recorded a non-cash impairment charge of $39.0 million in Account 426.5 to write down the carrying value of certain assets associated with the Northern Access project, which Supply Corporation will no longer be pursuing. The impairment charge reduced the value of certain assets recorded in Account 183.2, Account 121 , Account 107 and Account 101 on the balance sheet.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value16" xlink:to="footnote16" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="16" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote18" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>This line item includes Gas Received from Shippers as Fuel and Company Use &amp; Surface Operating Allowance. The majority is Fuel and Company Use.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value18" xlink:to="footnote18" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="18" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote19" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The line item represents gas received from shippers as Transportation and Storage Lost &amp; Unaccounted For.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value19" xlink:to="footnote19" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="19" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote20" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Net negative imbalances decreased inventory by 99,475 dth for the year (column c) and net positive imbalances increased inventory by 14,061 dth for the quarter (column d).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value20" xlink:to="footnote20" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="20" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote21" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Net activity for the year, including gas retainage charged and fuel use, increased inventory by 462,404 dth for the year (column c) and 375,618 dth for the quarter (column d).</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value21" xlink:to="footnote21" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="21" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote22" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Total receipts reflects the flow period of 1/1/25 through 12/31/25 for the year (column c) and 10/1/25 through 12/31/25 for the quarter (column d) for Lines 4, 5, and 7. All other lines reflect the flow period of 12/1/24 through 11/30/25 for the year and 9/1/25 through 11/30/25 for the quarter.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value22" xlink:to="footnote22" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="22" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote23" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Interruptible commodity volumes of 1,504,455 dth for the year (column c) and 360,635 dth for the quarter (column d). The total volumes of 1,717,191 dth for the year and 416,921 dth for the quarter are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value23" xlink:to="footnote23" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="23" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote24" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Includes volumes related to lease agreements with Empire Pipeline, Tennessee Gas Pipeline and Transcontinental Gas Pipeline totaling 66,643,952 dth for the year (column c) and 16,750,986 dth for the quarter (column d) which are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value24" xlink:to="footnote24" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="24" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote25" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Includes volumes related to a lease agreement with Empire Pipeline totaling 3,512,932 dth for the year (column c) and 1,127,944 dth for the quarter (column d) which are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value25" xlink:to="footnote25" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="25" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote26" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>These volumes are also included in the volumes on line 20. These volumes are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value26" xlink:to="footnote26" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="26" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote27" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>This line represents all fuel used by Supply Corporation. These volumes are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value27" xlink:to="footnote27" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="27" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote28" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>These volumes represent other measurement adjustments. These volumes are not subject to ACA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value28" xlink:to="footnote28" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="28" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote30" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Total Deliveries &amp; Unaccounted For reflects the flow period of 1/1/25 through 12/31/25 for the year (column c) and 10/1/25 through 12/31/25 for the quarter (column d) for Lines 19, 20 and 22. All other lines reflect the flow period of 12/1/24 through 11/30/25 for the year and 9/1/25 through 11/30/25 for the quarter.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value30" xlink:to="footnote30" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="30" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote31" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, transmission volumes also includes gas coming on to the transmission system from gathering since there is no separate shrinkage retained on gathering volumes.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value31" xlink:to="footnote31" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="31" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote32" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, gas used in transmission compressors is allocated between the rate types (columns b, c and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for transmission per line 4 on page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value32" xlink:to="footnote32" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="32" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote33" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, gas used in storage compressors is allocated between rate types (columns b, c and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for storage per line 6 on page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value33" xlink:to="footnote33" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="33" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote34" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, total gas used for other deliveries and gas used for other operations is allocated between rate types (column b, c, and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for each contract type per lines 2-6 on page 521. These amounts are due to measurement adjustments.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value34" xlink:to="footnote34" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="34" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote35" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, gathering losses are allocated between the rate types (columns b, c and d) based on percentage of gas transported for transmission per line 4 on page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value35" xlink:to="footnote35" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="35" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote36" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, transmission losses are allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for transmission per line 4 on page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value36" xlink:to="footnote36" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="36" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote37" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, storage losses are allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of gas transported for storage per line 6 on page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value37" xlink:to="footnote37" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="37" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote38" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, other losses (gains) represent measurement adjustments (related to transmission, storage and gathering losses (gains)) made to the 9/1/25 through 11/30/25 flow period subsequent to 11/30/25, and as a result, are allocated between the rate types (column b, c and d) based on the percentage of total shipper supplied gas transported per line 7 on page 521.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value38" xlink:to="footnote38" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="38" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote39" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>For the months of October, November and December, excess gas retained for each month is valued at 100% of the monthly cashout index rate for the respective month for columns f, g, h and i.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value39" xlink:to="footnote39" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="39" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote40" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 35.052%; height: 178px;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; text-align: center; height: 20px;">For the year</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; text-align: center; height: 20px;">For the quarter</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; text-align: center; height: 20px;">(column c)</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; text-align: center; height: 20px;">(column d)</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">Gathering System Losses</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">336,704</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">85,003</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">Transmission System Losses</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">2,120,946</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">589,505</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">Storage Losses</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">258,444</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">52,356</xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">Other Losses/(Gains)</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">(197,253</xhtml:span>)</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">(178,918)</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
            <xhtml:tr style="height: 20px;">
              <xhtml:td style="width: 30.8065%; height: 20px;">Total Gas Losses &amp; Gas Unaccounted For</xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 6.75888%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">2,518,841</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 7.4957%; height: 20px; text-align: right;">
                <xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">547,946</xhtml:span>
              </xhtml:td>
            </xhtml:tr>
          </xhtml:tbody>
        </xhtml:table>
        <xhtml:p>"Gathering System Losses" shown here are a combination of system losses and measurement error. Quantities of each of these system losses and measurement errors cannot be determined separately.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>"Transmission System Losses" shown here are a combination of system losses and measurement error. Quantities of each of these system losses and measurement errors cannot be determined separately.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>"Other Losses/(Gains)" represent measurement adjustments (related to transmission, storage and gathering losses/(gains)) made to the 12/1/24 through 11/30/25 flow period for the year (197,253 dth gain (column c)). There were measurement adjustments made to the 9/1/25 through 11/30/25 flow period for the quarter (178,918 dth gain (column d)).</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value40" xlink:to="footnote40" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="40" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote41" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI93-5-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value41" xlink:to="footnote41" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="41" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote42" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>18 CFR Section 154.402 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value42" xlink:to="footnote42" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="42" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote43" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>RS92-21-004, 006, 007, 008 &amp; 009 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value43" xlink:to="footnote43" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="43" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote44" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI02-1-000 and RM02-7-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value44" xlink:to="footnote44" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="44" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote45" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI07-1-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value45" xlink:to="footnote45" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="45" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote46" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Stipulation and Agreement filed on May 22, 2012 under Docket No. RP12-88-000 and subsequently approved by the Commission on August 6, 2012 provided authorization for this deferral. Activity for the year includes any over-collection or under-collection of retained quantities as well as an adjustment to revalue the liability at the December 31, 2025 100% cashout index rate.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value46" xlink:to="footnote46" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="46" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote47" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Under Supply Corporation's tariff, this amount represents an overrecovery of transportation and storage cost adjustment costs under Rate Schedule EFT.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value47" xlink:to="footnote47" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="47" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote48" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Supply Corporation reclassifies regulatory assets in Account 182.3 that have credit balances to regulatory liabilities in Account 254.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value48" xlink:to="footnote48" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="48" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote49" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI93-5-000 provides the regulatory authority for this deferral and was reaffirmed by Docket No. PL19-2-000.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value49" xlink:to="footnote49" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="49" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote50" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Supply Corporation established a regulatory liability for environmental insurance settlement proceeds. Such proceeds were deferred as a regulatory liability to be applied against any future environmental claims that may be incurred. The proceeds have been classified as a regulatory liability in recognition of the fact that rate payers funded premiums on the former insurance policies.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value50" xlink:to="footnote50" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="50" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote51" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>AI02-1-000 and RM02-7-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value51" xlink:to="footnote51" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="51" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote52" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>RM95-4-000 provided the authorization for this deferral.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value52" xlink:to="footnote52" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="52" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote53" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Supply Corporation reclassifies regulatory assets in Account 182.3 that have credit balances to regulatory liabilities in Account 254.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value53" xlink:to="footnote53" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="53" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote55" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Empire Pipeline, Inc. leases storage capacity and associated transportation capacity from National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation to provide no-notice services (FSNN and FTNN). Empire Pipeline, Inc.'s current lease of 3,753,090 Dth of 68-day storage capacity provides a maximum withdrawal quantity of 55,000 Dth per day.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value55" xlink:to="footnote55" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="55" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote57" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation's FM100 project was completed and went fully in service on December 19, 2021. As part of the Capacity Lease Agreement, Supply Corporation will lease 330,000 Dth per day to Transcontinental Gas Pipe Line Company, LLC from Clermont to Leidy Delivery Point.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value57" xlink:to="footnote57" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="57" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote58" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Effective December 1, 2015, Tennessee Gas Pipeline obtained leased transportation capacity from National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation. Supply Corporation has offered 140,000 Dth per day of capacity on its system to Tennessee Gas Pipeline, from Ellisburg Station for redelivery to Tennessee Gas Pipeline in East Eden, New York.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value58" xlink:to="footnote58" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="58" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote59" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>On May 1, 2018, Supply Corporation entered into a transportation capacity lease and service agreement with Tennessee Gas Pipeline Company. Supply Corporation leases 40,000 dth per day of transportation capacity along Tennessee's 200 line system between Supply Corporation's existing interconnections at East Aurora, NY and Mercer, PA.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value59" xlink:to="footnote59" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="59" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote60" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 16px;">Supply Corporation uses the fixed asset model provisions of FERC Order 581 in accounting for its storage gas recorded in Account 117.4.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value60" xlink:to="footnote60" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="60" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote61" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>"Gas Stored Underground - Current" includes (a) -$1,822,220 gas reclassified from Account 117.3 since such amounts are expected to be passed back to / (or collected from) customers though rate tracking mechanisms and (b) $90,173 of base gas transferred from Account 117.1 related to base gas held for sale authorized by FERC in Docket No. CP22-482-000.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value61" xlink:to="footnote61" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="61" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote62" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The source of the capital structure figures is Supply Corporation's parent company, National Fuel Gas Company.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value62" xlink:to="footnote62" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="62" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote63" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The source of the capital structure figures is Supply Corporation's parent company, National Fuel Gas Company.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value63" xlink:to="footnote63" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="63" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote64" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Estimated allowed rate of return in FERC Case RP23-929, effective February 1, 2024.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value64" xlink:to="footnote64" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="64" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote67" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The excess of the Empire Gas and Fuel Company capitalization over the current value of the Empire stock at 12/31/1965. United and Empire merged under the provisions of F.P.C. Order dated 1/28/1966, Docket No. CP66-145: $29,950</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>United Natural Gas Company, Pennsylvania Gas Company, and Iroquois Gas Corporation, merged under provisions of F.P.C. Order issued 5/10/1974, Docket Nos. CP73-294 and CP74-211: $5,031,822</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>The Sylvania Corp. merged into National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation under the provisions of F.E.R.C. Order issued 12/29/1975, Docket No. CP75-344: $1,500,000</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Penn-York Energy Corporation merged into National Fuel Gas Supply Corporation under the provisions of F.E.R.C. Order issued 1/19/1994, Docket No. CP92-505-000: $29,332,377</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>
        </xhtml:p>
